# Photoroom Remove Background API (white-BG step)
# Get key: https://docs.photoroom.com/getting-started/introduction
# Never commit the real key.
#
# Privacy: face/head crops are sent to Photoroom when white-BG is enabled
# (third-party egress — ensure DPA/retention coverage for your deployment).
PHOTOROOM_API_KEY=

# URL overrides are not supported (fixed allowlist: https://sdk.photoroom.com/v1/segment).
# Setting PHOTOROOM_API_URL to any other value causes white-BG to fail-open.
